{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Hikkoshi Moving Box Notes 專為搬家收納而設，讓你記錄每個紙箱裝了什麼、屬於哪個房間，拆箱時不必逐箱翻找。適合即將搬遷、需要整理大量物品的家庭或租客使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自動分配箱號記錄物品</h2>\n<p>為紙箱命名並選擇房間，加入箱內物品後可按名稱搜尋。箱號會自動分配，把同一號碼寫在實體紙箱上即可對應記錄。記錄時可點選常見物品名稱快速填入，補上數量、單位與備註。可按房間瀏覽紙箱，標記易碎箱並決定優先開箱次序。搜尋支援箱號與內容，亦可列印 A4 QR 標籤在 App 內掃描查看。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-149-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-150-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-151-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-152-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-153-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-154-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Hikkoshi Moving Box Notes</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T23:19:43.208258+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}